    "title": "Logo <span class=\"highlight\">design</span> for luxury clothing <span class=\"highlight\">brand</span>",
    "description": "Hi! I’m looking for a talented <span class=\"highlight\">designer</span> to create a luxury visual identity for my fashion <span class=\"highlight\">brand</span>, AVORÉN.\n\nAt this stage, I only need:\n\n* A custom AVORÉN wordmark/logo\n* An AV monogram\n* A simple <span class=\"highlight\">brand</span> icon/house mark\n\nThe style should be minimal, timeless, elegant, and premium. The <span class=\"highlight\">designs</span> need to be completely original and versatile enough to work on clothing labels, embroidery, packaging, zipper pulls, hardware, and future leather goods.\n\nI’m looking for a luxury aesthetic—not streetwear or trendy graphics.\n\nPlease include:\n\n* Portfolio examples of luxury or fashion <span class=\"highlight\">branding</span>\n* Your pricing\n* Estimated turnaround time\n\nFinal files should include AI, SVG, EPS, PDF, and transparent PNG formats.\n\nThank you—I look forward to seeing your work.",
